{"3646860":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"KOEGASURU","steam_appid":3646860,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own music video by controlling Hatsune Miku!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The process of clearing the riddles is all recorded, so you will be able to create your own music video.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controles<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and click only!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy and intuitive controls.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3646860\/extras\/f5acb57d45c18f8519b9c639ef37edc6.avif?t=1745581607\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3646860\/extras_big\/f5acb57d45c18f8519b9c639ef37edc6.avif?t=1745581607 width=800 height=590 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus your cursor on suspicious objects and click on it. Once you clear the game, you can play a hidden mode⁉ An escape room game set in the music video &quot;KOEGASURU&quot; by TEMPLIME!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction of Creators<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEMPLIME<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3646860\/extras\/c98e712c2d3004b3ff9ddc545b4e28c9.avif?t=1745581607\" width=800 height=800 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEMPLIME<\/strong> is a music unit consisting of composer <strong>KBSNK<\/strong> and DJ <strong>tempura<\/strong>. They began their activities in April 2019 and released their debut track “<strong>Neon Light<\/strong>,” featuring digital artist <strong>Toto Hoshimiya<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2020, their album <strong>“Cloud Diver”<\/strong> ranked 4th on the <strong>Billboard Japan Download Albums Chart<\/strong>. Since then, they have been active in various collaborations, including an <strong>official remix for Vaundy<\/strong>, and providing tracks for artists and projects such as <strong>Tomori Kusunoki<\/strong>, <strong>Denkoubu<\/strong>, <strong>Kokonatsu 2.0<\/strong>, and <strong>ExWHYZ<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In March 2023, their track <strong>“Escapism”<\/strong> was selected for <strong>Porter Robinson’s<\/strong> playlist <strong>“cherished music”<\/strong>, gaining international attention.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2024, they released <strong>“EMPT MILE”<\/strong>, their first full-length album as a solo project, continuing to pursue their musical activities with vigor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOCHIDAIKOUGAKUBU<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3646860\/extras\/0436cd3f368c82df9685b549c45200be.avif?t=1745581607\" width=800 height=800 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creative circle consisting of Zumochi, in charge of illustration and 3D modeling, and YuKiMuMa, responsible for programming, video production, and product development.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Game Design】<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOCHIDAIKOUGAKUBU　TEMPLIME <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Programming】<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YuKiMuMa Zumochi SHI maru<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Art】  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zumochi YuKiMuMa Hiyori Kimura <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Sound】 <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > KBSNK<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own music video by controlling Hatsune Miku!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The process of clearing the riddles is all recorded, so you will be able to create your own music video.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controles<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and click only!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy and intuitive controls.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3646860\/extras\/f5acb57d45c18f8519b9c639ef37edc6.avif?t=1745581607\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3646860\/extras_big\/f5acb57d45c18f8519b9c639ef37edc6.avif?t=1745581607 width=800 height=590 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus your cursor on suspicious objects and click on it. Once you clear the game, you can play a hidden mode⁉ An escape room game set in the music video &quot;KOEGASURU&quot; by TEMPLIME!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction of Creators<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEMPLIME<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3646860\/extras\/c98e712c2d3004b3ff9ddc545b4e28c9.avif?t=1745581607\" width=800 height=800 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEMPLIME<\/strong> is a music unit consisting of composer <strong>KBSNK<\/strong> and DJ <strong>tempura<\/strong>. They began their activities in April 2019 and released their debut track “<strong>Neon Light<\/strong>,” featuring digital artist <strong>Toto Hoshimiya<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2020, their album <strong>“Cloud Diver”<\/strong> ranked 4th on the <strong>Billboard Japan Download Albums Chart<\/strong>. Since then, they have been active in various collaborations, including an <strong>official remix for Vaundy<\/strong>, and providing tracks for artists and projects such as <strong>Tomori Kusunoki<\/strong>, <strong>Denkoubu<\/strong>, <strong>Kokonatsu 2.0<\/strong>, and <strong>ExWHYZ<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In March 2023, their track <strong>“Escapism”<\/strong> was selected for <strong>Porter Robinson’s<\/strong> playlist <strong>“cherished music”<\/strong>, gaining international attention.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2024, they released <strong>“EMPT MILE”<\/strong>, their first full-length album as a solo project, continuing to pursue their musical activities with vigor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOCHIDAIKOUGAKUBU<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3646860\/extras\/0436cd3f368c82df9685b549c45200be.avif?t=1745581607\" width=800 height=800 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creative circle consisting of Zumochi, in charge of illustration and 3D modeling, and YuKiMuMa, responsible for programming, video production, and product development.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Game Design】<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOCHIDAIKOUGAKUBU　TEMPLIME <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Programming】<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YuKiMuMa Zumochi SHI maru<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Art】  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zumochi YuKiMuMa Hiyori Kimura <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Sound】 <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > KBSNK<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Create your own music video by controlling Hatsune Miku! When you solve the 4 riddles, a music video will be created of you solving the riddles! It is an escape room game set in the music video &quot;KOEGASURU&quot; by TEMPLIME!","supported_languages":"영어, 일본어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\